==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 200 series|200 series]] (4-car sets):
*: Introduced in 2016 to replace the original fleet. These AGT vehicles are recognizable by their playful exterior designs; each trainset features a different color theme (e.g., "Ocean Blue," "Sunset Orange," "Park Green") representing different aspects of the bay area. They feature large windows and forward-facing seats at the ends of the train for panoramic views of the harbor.

